{"4617070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sklesh", "steam_appid": 4617070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE NETWORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot up.<br>Log in.<br>Battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything runs on an old system here. Old CRT monitor and noisy hard drives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, power up your creature, and connect to the network and battle to be the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK, SHAPE YOUR STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing set of spells and abilities to create your load out. The way you build your deck directly affects how your creature performs in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find combinations that work. Adjust your strategy. Try something new when it fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches are 1v1v1v1, so it is not just about being strong. It is about making the right moves at the right time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Mode</strong><br>Start from scratch and build your run as you go. Pick up new cards, improve your setup, and see how far you can make it before you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Async Multiplayer</strong><br>Battle against other players by taking on their saved builds and recorded moves. Learn from them, counter them, and climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Mode</strong><br>Everyone gets the same creature and the same six cards each day. The only difference is how you use them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE TERMINAL YOURS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change how your desktop looks and feels. Adjust colors and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE NETWORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players are out there doing the same thing as you. Building, testing, and improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches. Refine your deck.<br>See how far you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the best on the network.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE NETWORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot up.<br>Log in.<br>Battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything runs on an old system here. Old CRT monitor and noisy hard drives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, power up your creature, and connect to the network and battle to be the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK, SHAPE YOUR STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing set of spells and abilities to create your load out. The way you build your deck directly affects how your creature performs in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find combinations that work. Adjust your strategy. Try something new when it fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches are 1v1v1v1, so it is not just about being strong. It is about making the right moves at the right time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Mode</strong><br>Start from scratch and build your run as you go. Pick up new cards, improve your setup, and see how far you can make it before you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Async Multiplayer</strong><br>Battle against other players by taking on their saved builds and recorded moves. Learn from them, counter them, and climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Mode</strong><br>Everyone gets the same creature and the same six cards each day. The only difference is how you use them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE TERMINAL YOURS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change how your desktop looks and feels. Adjust colors and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE NETWORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players are out there doing the same thing as you. Building, testing, and improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches. Refine your deck.<br>See how far you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the best on the network.</p>", "short_description": "A terminal-based battler where you build decks, evolve creatures, and fight for dominance across a fading digital network.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617070/029989461bcabe7481b7ca5ee5a73272df052da5/header.jpg?t=1777949981", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617070/eb264c3b011d5f3826195c69ddd7508820de3bea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777949981", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617070/eb264c3b011d5f3826195c69ddd7508820de3bea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777949981", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 520 / Vega 8 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 560 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<b